	(text "Temperature: TEMP high and GAIN1 low (gain 2); the sensor does not work at gain 64 or 128.\nDiode difference 111.7 mV at 25 C, 379 uV/C: relative, calibrate one point."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "48cc7b10-773d-518a-9cff-0f287a514fa0")
	)
	(text "XIAO ESP32-S3 pins\nD0  GPIO1   ADC_GAIN1 (high 128, low 2)\nD1  GPIO2   ADC_SPEED (low 10 SPS, high 80 SPS)\nD2  GPIO3   ADC_PDWN, R4 pull-down\nD3  GPIO4   ADC_DOUT (DRDY/DOUT)\nD4  GPIO5   ADC_SCLK\nD5  GPIO6   ADC_TEMP (high: die temperature)\nD6  GPIO43  free (UART0 TX)\nD7  GPIO44  free (UART0 RX)\nD8  GPIO7   STATUS_LED\nD9  GPIO8   CAN_RX (as combined)\nD10 GPIO9   CAN_TX\nPins follow the layout: U1 pins 20 to 24 fan out to D0 to D4 (SCLK and DOUT crossed), the bus side sits on D8 to D10.\nXIAO 5V pin = VBUS: never plug USB-C while it sits on the board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4805f87b-3037-50f9-9234-e9bffc2aaa01")
	)
